      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "device",
      "note": "工信部进网许可标志三行信息之一；国行蜂窝机型才有，海外版/非蜂窝 unknown 或 not_applicable。jwxk.miit.gov.cn 可验真"
    },
    {
      "path": "device.srrcId",
      "label": "CMIIT ID",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "device",
      "note": "SRRC 无线电发射设备型号核准代码（如 26J44XA31643）；含射频器件（WLAN/蓝牙/蜂窝）的设备均需核准。只存原文"
    },
    {
